# JetBrains/Kotlin build output. Generated during gradle builds; never tracked.
# Without these, `git add -A` during upstream merges sweeps in deep .class
# paths that also exceed the Windows path limit. See FORK-MERGE.md Â§5.
**/backend/build/
**/frontend/build/
**/shared/build/
**/build/classes/
**/build/kotlin/
**/build/libs/
**/build/reports/
**/build/test-results/
**/build/tmp/

